VALUES ('4aab175b-0212-4aef-9885-63b3876d1829', 'NC26.3.ANR.2', 3, 'numeric', 'Strategies and properties of addition and subtraction', 'Rita subtracted to find $812 - 475$. To check, she added her answer to 475 and got 812. What was Rita''s answer?', '[]', '337', '812-475', 'Her answer plus 475 makes 812, so her answer is $812 - 475$. Count up from 475 to 500 is 25, to 800 is 300 more, to 812 is 12 more. $25 + 300 + 12 = 337$. Check: $337 + 475 = 812$.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"337","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"812 - 475 = 337. Check 337 + 475 = 812.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-17T19:22:04.103Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
