VALUES ('f6e5d786-462d-4617-97c9-1657ca9b4971', 'NC26.3.ANR.6', 1, 'numeric', 'Two-step: add two products', 'Sam has 3 bags with 2 red marbles in each bag and 2 bags with 5 blue marbles in each bag. How many marbles does he have in all?', '[]', '16', '3*2+2*5', 'The red marbles are $3 \times 2 = 6$. The blue marbles are $2 \times 5 = 10$. In all, $6 + 10 = 16$ marbles.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"16","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"3 x 2 = 6 red; 2 x 5 = 10 blue; 6 + 10 = 16.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-17T19:23:45.733Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
