VALUES ('177090e6-6f0e-46f3-aa74-fbc1979b12e0', 'NC26.3.ANR.6', 1, 'choice', 'Two-step: add two products', 'Mom buys 2 packs of apples with 3 apples in each pack and 2 packs of oranges with 4 oranges in each pack. How many pieces of fruit does she buy?', '["11","14","28","24"]', '14', '2*3+2*4', 'The apples are $2 \times 3 = 6$ and the oranges are $2 \times 4 = 8$, so $6 + 8 = 14$. The choice 11 adds all four numbers, 28 multiplies (2 + 2) by (3 + 4), and 24 multiplies 2 by 3 by 4.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"14","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"2 x 3 = 6 apples; 2 x 4 = 8 oranges; 6 + 8 = 14.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-17T19:23:45.733Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
