VALUES ('5acf8399-78d1-4540-a6f6-718aae9aa177', 'NC26.3.ANR.6', 1, 'choice', 'Two-step: "more than" and "fewer than" stories', 'Dan picked 10 apples. Eve picked 4 fewer apples than Dan. How many apples did Dan and Eve pick in all?', '["6","14","20","16"]', '16', '10+(10-4)', 'Eve picked $10 - 4 = 6$ apples. Together $10 + 6 = 16$. The choice 6 is only Eve, 14 adds the 4 instead, and 20 counts Eve as having the same as Dan.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"16","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"Eve 10 - 4 = 6; together 10 + 6 = 16.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-17T19:23:45.733Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
