VALUES ('3391ebb0-dcd7-4737-8e36-e4b73067cd9a', 'NC26.3.ANR.6', 3, 'choice', 'Two-step: multiply, then add more', 'Maya reads 6 pages each night for 8 nights. Then she reads 17 pages in one afternoon. How many pages does she read in all?', '["48","31","150","65"]', '65', '6*8+17', 'The nights give $6 \times 8 = 48$ pages, and $48 + 17 = 65$. The choice 48 forgets the afternoon, 31 adds 6 + 8 + 17, and 150 multiplies 6 by (8 + 17).', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"65","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"6 x 8 = 48 pages; 48 + 17 = 65.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-17T19:23:45.733Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
