VALUES ('7e69a79c-85c7-41f2-abd5-b1170eb49cde', 'NC26.3.ANR.6', 3, 'choice', 'Two-step: three numbers to add or subtract', 'A jar has 500 beads in it. Lila uses 128 beads for a bracelet and 175 beads for a necklace. How many beads are left in the jar?', '["372","303","197","803"]', '197', '500-128-175', 'After the bracelet $500 - 128 = 372$. After the necklace $372 - 175 = 197$. The choice 372 forgets the necklace, 303 is the number of beads used, and 803 adds everything.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"197","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"128 + 175 = 303 used; 500 - 303 = 197.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-17T19:23:45.733Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
