VALUES ('5a222618-e3ea-48ed-bed0-8b2e485f72cf', 'NC26.3.RD.1', 1, 'numeric', 'Read a picture graph with a key', 'In a picture graph, each cup picture stands for 3 glasses of juice. The juice row stands for 12 glasses. How many cup pictures are in the juice row?', '[]', '4', '12/3', 'Each cup is 3 glasses, so the number of cups is $12 \div 3 = 4$. Check: $4 \times 3 = 12$.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"4","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"12 / 3 = 4 cup pictures.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-17T19:22:45.144Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
