VALUES ('ff8a622a-420c-4c9e-b636-822aaa456d09', 'NC26.4.ANR.1', 2, 'numeric', 'Use place value to build or find a number', 'Dana''s five-digit number has a 3 in the ten-thousands place. The digit in the thousands place is twice that digit. All the other digits are 0. What is her number?', '[]', '36000', '30000+6000', 'The thousands digit is 2 x 3 = 6. The number is 3 ten-thousands and 6 thousands: 36,000.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"36000","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"Ten-thousands 3, thousands 2 x 3 = 6, rest 0: 36,000.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-17T20:03:27.854Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
