VALUES ('50e855a2-69a6-45fd-ba3d-e6d6481d644a', 'NC26.4.ANR.4', 1, 'numeric', 'Equation with a letter: write and solve for a story', 'Mia has 5 bags of apples with $p$ apples in each bag. She gives 4 apples to a friend and has 21 apples left. The equation $5 \times p - 4 = 21$ matches the story. How many apples are in each bag?', '[]', '5', '(21+4)/5', 'Add the 4 back: $21 + 4 = 25$, so $5 \times p = 25$. Then $p = 25 \div 5 = 5$ apples in each bag.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"5","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"5p = 21 + 4 = 25; p = 5.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-17T19:23:39.170Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
