VALUES ('849f6366-45e4-4807-8942-2a7e319ce00d', 'NC26.5.ANR.6', 1, 'choice', 'Describe the relationship between matching terms of two patterns', 'Pattern P is 10, 20, 30, 40. Pattern Q is 5, 10, 15, 20. How is each number in Q related to the matching number in P?', '["Each number in Q is half the matching number in P","Each number in Q is 5 less than the matching number in P","Each number in Q is 2 times the matching number in P","Each number in Q is 5 more than the matching number in P"]', 'Each number in Q is half the matching number in P', NULL, 'Match them up: $10 \to 5$, $20 \to 10$, $30 \to 15$, $40 \to 20$. Each number in Q is half of the number in P. It is not always 5 less (20 to 10 is 10 less).', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"Each number in Q is half the matching number in P","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"5 = 10/2, 10 = 20/2, 15 = 30/2, 20 = 40/2. Each Q number is half the matching P number.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-17T20:08:42.947Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
