VALUES ('523f08b0-43b6-4d3e-a65f-292b6954edcc', 'NC26.5.ANR.6', 1, 'choice', 'Use the relationship between two patterns to find a term', 'Pattern M is 5, 10, 15, 20, ... Pattern N is 10, 20, 30, 40, ... The 6th number in Pattern M is 30. What is the 6th number in Pattern N?', '["35","30","90","60"]', '60', '30*2', 'Each number in N is 2 times the matching number in M ($5 \to 10$, $10 \to 20$, $15 \to 30$). So the 6th number in N is $30 \times 2 = 60$.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"60","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"Each N number is 2 times the matching M number (10 = 2 x 5, ...). 6th in N = 2 x 30 = 60. Check: 10, 20, 30, 40, 50, 60.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-17T20:08:42.947Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
