VALUES ('61c0e9f8-9261-47d6-81b0-43bd58515047', 'NC26.5.SGMR.1', 1, 'choice', 'Name a quadrilateral from its properties', 'A four-sided shape has 4 right angles. Its opposite sides are equal, but its sides are not all the same length. What is the most specific name for it?', '["Square","Rectangle","Rhombus","Trapezoid"]', 'Rectangle', NULL, 'Four right angles with opposite sides equal makes a rectangle. A square would need all four sides equal, and a rhombus is defined by four equal sides.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"Rectangle","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"4 right angles and opposite sides equal: rectangle. Sides not all equal, so not a square. Most specific: rectangle.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-17T20:03:27.817Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
