VALUES ('4e9f6ab3-ccb4-485a-8dd9-e80a8942bc12', 'NC26.5.SGMR.1', 1, 'numeric', 'Count shapes that have an attribute', 'A class makes a poster of four shapes: square, rectangle, parallelogram and rhombus. Under the heading "Both pairs of opposite sides are equal in length" the teacher writes every shape that ALWAYS fits. How many shapes does she write under the heading?', '[]', '4', NULL, 'Every parallelogram has opposite sides equal, and rectangles, rhombuses and squares are all parallelograms. So all 4 shapes fit.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"4","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"All four are parallelograms, so all have both pairs of opposite sides equal: 4.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-17T20:03:27.817Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
