VALUES ('1fbf1fd2-b9dc-4169-8652-d44f8174536f', 'NC26.5.SGMR.4', 1, 'choice', 'Volume of a composite solid', 'A toy is made by joining two blocks. One block is 2 cm by 2 cm by 2 cm. The other block is 3 cm by 2 cm by 1 cm. What is the volume of the whole toy, in cubic centimeters?', '["48","14","12","8"]', '14', '2*2*2+3*2*1', 'The first block is $2 \times 2 \times 2 = 8$ and the second is $3 \times 2 \times 1 = 6$. Together: $8 + 6 = 14$. Multiplying the two volumes gives 48.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"14","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"2x2x2 = 8; 3x2x1 = 6; 8 + 6 = 14 cubic cm.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-17T19:22:28.485Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
