VALUES ('909aeadc-77ec-47b1-a1fd-d9c2046fb162', 'NC26.8.SGMR.1', 3, 'numeric', 'Find the image after two transformations', 'The point (2, -7) is reflected across the $x$-axis and then rotated $90^\circ$ counterclockwise about the origin. What is the $y$-coordinate of the final point?', '[]', '2', '2', 'The reflection gives (2, 7). The rotation uses $(x, y) \to (-y, x)$ and gives (-7, 2). The $y$-coordinate is 2.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"2","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"(2, -7) -> across x-axis (2, 7) -> 90 CCW (-y, x) = (-7, 2). y = 2.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-17T20:28:40.358Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
